  "body": "# Main\r\n\r\n- Update go build version to 1.27 (1cff2562)\r\n- Update dependencies (eb75edcb)\r\n\r\n# Other\r\n\r\n- Add support xiaomi lumi.camera.gwagl01 (7793a558)\r\n- Add support xiaomi isa.camera.isc5c1 (06cbbe55)\r\n- Add support xiaomi chuangmi.camera.v2 on old firmwares (a37fdf38)\r\n- Add support xiaomi chuangmi.camera.ipc019e (8f68f80b)\r\n- Add support xiaomi isa.camera.df3 on old firmwares (6374366d)\r\n- Add trace log for xiaomi devices list (6f75b2f7)\r\n- Add support PCMATapo for MPEG-TS source #2159 by @ludufre (dc1685e9)\r\n- Add camera.ui link to projects #2349 by @seydx (c245815e)\r\n- Add support pet feeder to xiaomi source #2078 (e5bb0334)\r\n- Move kasa source to separate module (44f6f111)\r\n- Restore fix audio sample rate for some xiaomi cameras #2006 (01c74515)\r\n- Improve packet loss on old TUTK proto (75bd1f1b)\r\n- Strip Userinfo from log entries and errors #2051 (de157eb1)\r\n- Rename mpegts module to mpeg (2735bafd)\r\n- Fix ice_servers parsing for a list of URLs #2064 by @jmelancondev (d1d7846a)\r\n- Fix zero channel for xiaomi source #2047 (2f9d1386)\r\n- Fix unknown msg 0xF0 for cs2 proto (366cbd20)\r\n- Fix error handling in stream creation and patching tests #2065 by @skrashevich (8d58cc7f)\r\n\r\n# Docs and site\r\n\r\n- Add meta info to website (e90f159c)\r\n- Add sitemap to website (f68c602a)\r\n- New documentation site #2044 by @skrashevich (7083afe9)\r\n- Update docs (be4b6c32)\r\n- Update documentation for clarity and accuracy #2058 by @skrashevich (6085c8aa)\r\n- Update README #1720 by @felipecrs (6eeba1ae)\r\n- Propose fix a couple of typos #2054 by @jeis4wpi (a41185c2)\r\n- Fix links in docs (f3ad4ad9)\r\n- Fix documentation grammar #2080 by @skrashevich (7f36033b)\r\n- Fix link to updated JSONSchema #2056 by @martinbjeldbak (c7938558)\r\n",
